## The Modelfile.md file is for use with Ollama. ##

### In order to use it, follow these instructions: ###

1. Install Ollama

2. Move Modelfile into the directory you want to keep similar files

3. Launch the terminal from that folder.

4. Use the following command to have Ollama automatically pull the model and create a copy with your ruleset:

$ ollama create <model-name> -f Modelfile

5. Then just run the new model. Enjoy!
